5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need a system that prevents friction. If people start timing their exits to avoid each other, the building’s atmosphere collapses.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, Asuka! Friction is the worst. I just want everyone to feel happy and safe leaving their bikes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The physical layout dictates the conflict. I need to understand the spatial constraints before proposing solutions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m not here to guess. I want to know the actual cost of this mess. Who’s paying for the headaches?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m curious about the operational burden. Who actually maintains the system once it’s set up?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, spatial constraints alone don’t explain social decay. I need to see the actual history of conflicts. @Shunichi, costs are secondary to community stability.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I hear you! But maybe we should check the complaint log to see if the grumbling is real or just feelings?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, complaints are subjective. I need objective data on usage patterns. @Shunichi, costs matter, but efficiency is the primary constraint here.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, feelings are data too. @Ryuji, efficiency is cheap if the budget is empty. I’m checking the ledger and the handover file.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, costs are necessary, but sustainability is vital. I’ll examine the minutes and the supplier’s frame to assess the long-term workload.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I’m checking the complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account. I need to see if this friction is unique to us or a systemic failure.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, I’ll check the sticker register and morning departures! I want to see who actually uses the spots and where they park.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, that covers usage. I will examine the rain exposure and the ward cycle park. I need to assess environmental degradation and external alternatives.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, checking the ledger and handover file. I need to know if we’re actually broke or just pretending to be.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, noted. I’ll review the five years of minutes and the supplier’s frame trial to gauge the actual maintenance burden.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I’m done. The complaint log and the neighbouring block’s account will reveal if our friction is systemic or isolated.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m done! The sticker register and morning departures will show me exactly who parks where. Let’s hope the data is kind!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the rain exposure and the ward cycle park. I need to assess environmental degradation and external alternatives.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’m done. The ledger and handover file will tell me if we’re actually broke or just pretending to be.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll review the five years of minutes and the supplier’s frame trial. I need to quantify the actual maintenance burden before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
